cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this dataset using the metadata in this file."
title: "Global Crop Observation Repository (GCOR)"
abstract: "A versioned compilation of field-based crop observations covering crop yield, methane and nitrous-oxide emissions, fertilizer inputs, and reported measurement methods. The dataset supports crop-model parameterization and validation for the study “Agricultural burdens emerge as crop climates depart from historical extremes”."
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - crop observations
  - crop yield
  - methane emissions
  - nitrous oxide emissions
  - fertilizer inputs
  - crop modelling
  - agricultural greenhouse gases
